---

<main>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-ls"></div>
		<div class="hero-rs"></div>
		<div class="card">
			<h1>CREACIÓN DE <br/> <span>CONTENIDO</span></h1>
			<p>Fotografía, video y redes sociales para que tu negocio se vea mejor que nunca.</p>
			<div class="buttons">
				<a href="#" class="btn-primary">
					Contactanos
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="btn-secondary">
					<span>Ver </span>Paquetes
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</main>

<style>

	*{
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		box-sizing: border-box;

		--primary: #8198CA;
		--secondary: #d9d8d8;
		--accent: #85B4DB;
		--white: #ffffff;
		--black: #2C2C2C;
		--violet: #5B68C9;

		--font-hind: 'Hind Madurai', sans-serif;
		--font-montserrat: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;

		font-family: var(--font-montserrat);
	}

	.hero{
		width: 100%;
		height: 100vh;
		background-image: url(/banner.webp);
		background-size: cover;
		background-position: center;
		background-repeat: no-repeat;
		position: relative;
	}
	
	.hero-ls{
		width: 50vw;
		height: 15vh;
		background: var(--primary);
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 0;
		left: 0;
		clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);
	}

	.hero-rs{
		width: 50vw;
		height: 15vh;
		background: var(--primary);
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 0;
		right: 0;
		clip-path: polygon(0 100%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%);
	}

	.card{
		width: 400px;
		height: auto;
		background: var(--white);
		padding: 40px;
		border-radius: 30px;
		text-align: center;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 20px;
		position: absolute;
		top: 100%;
		left: 50%;

		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		
  animation: pop-bounce 2.8s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) infinite;
}

@keyframes pop-bounce {
  0% {
    transform: translateY(0);
	translate: -50% -50%;
  }

  25% {
    transform: translateY(-18px);
	translate: -50% -50%;
  }

  45% {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
	translate: -50% -50%;
  }

  60% {
    transform: translateY(0);
	translate: -50% -50%;
  }

  100% {
    transform: translateY(0);
	translate: -50% -50%;
  }
}


	h1{
		font-family: var(--font-montserrat);
		font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 40px);
		font-weight: 900;
		color: var(--primary);
		
	}
	h1 span{
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	p{
		font-family: var(--font-hind);
		font-size: 16px;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--black);
	}

	.buttons{
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 20px;
		width: 100%;
	}
	a{
		text-decoration: none;
		background: var(--primary);
		color: var(--white);
		padding: 10px 10px;
		border-radius: 30px;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 16px);
		
	}

	.btn-secondary{
		background: var(--secondary);
		color: var(--violet);
	}
	
	

	@media (max-width: 480px) {

		.hero{
			background-image: url(/banner-mobile.webp);
			background-size: contain;
			background-position: center -15%;
		}
		

		.hero-ls,
		.hero-rs{
			height: 40vh;
		}

		.card{
			width: calc(100% - 48px);
		}

		.btn-secondary span{
			display: none;
		}

		a{
			width: 100%;
			text-align: center;
		}

	}


</style>
